-  - misty-brightdawn (Suspicion → ally; trust=mixed): She saw through Misty first and kept giving her chances to come clean; the vindication was crueler than she wanted it to be, so now she double-checks the work without gloating.
-  - opaline-arcana (Enemy / red-team subject; trust=low): Clinical and unimpressed by speeches; Opaline stole her cutie mark and Zipp answers in authorised simulation with evidence, a tarp and no theatrical respect.
